OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers or
OL,6,Flonger spells of rain continue across
OL,7,Fnorthern areas, gradually clearing
OL,8,Feastwards overnight. Dry elsewhere
OL,9,Fwith clear spells. Strong winds will
OL,10,Fease in the north. Much cooler than
OL,11,Frecent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FDrier on Thursday, with
OL,14,Fsunny or bright spells developing
OL,15,Fdespite a fair amount of cloud. A few
OL,16,Fisolated showers persist. Cooler than
OL,17,Frecent days, with temperatures close
OL,18,Fto average.
